4.4 Optimize—find the optimal composition, component ratios, and the dose to yield maximum treatment effect relevant for the clinical studies
In this step, the effect of drugs and drug combinations will be further evaluated in the experimental and computational models to determine the optimal drug characteristics, individual concentrations, and optimal dose. Translational modeling approaches, such as quantitative systems pharmacology (QSP,
Azer et al., 2021
;
Bai et al., 2019
;
EFPIA MID3 Workgroup et al., 2016
;
Berg et al., 2005
